72ab2dbb-4bb8-44b8-aaf0-02e6fffd1d0f	67f0d80b-81ed-4f14-8dcb-35705b466da1	Cost accountant are responsible to decide level of price as the in position to to understand cost of production please send me answer true or false	False. Cost accountants are responsible for analyzing and recording the costs of production, but they do not have the authority to decide the level of price. Pricing decisions are typically made by sales and marketing teams, taking into consideration various factors such as market demand, competition, and profit margins.	110
