2107a24c-aef9-42c9-9c55-f5093ea850ec	9867e2c4-f124-4f1a-9f04-d4b161706467	AMAZON Select one information system implemented by the organizatio	One information system implemented by Amazon is their Order Management System (OMS). The OMS is responsible for managing the entire order fulfillment process, from the moment a customer places an order to the delivery of the product.\n\nThe OMS integrates with various systems within Amazon's infrastructure, such as inventory management, warehouse management, and shipping carriers, to ensure efficient and accurate order processing. It tracks the status of each order, manages inventory levels, and coordinates the movement of products from warehouses to customers.\n\nAdditionally, the OMS provides real-time visibility into order status for both customers and internal stakeholders. It enables customers to track their orders and receive updates on delivery times. Internally, it allows Amazon's customer service representatives to access order information and provide timely support to customers.\n\nOverall, the Order Management System plays a crucial role in Amazon's operations, ensuring smooth order processing and timely delivery, which contributes to their reputation for excellent customer service.	224
77f623b6-7fdb-4bfb-a610-c37114087249	9867e2c4-f124-4f1a-9f04-d4b161706467	IN AMZON Investigate the information system in terms of its components and activities as well as levels of management and decision structure it supports.	Amazon's information system is a complex and sophisticated system that supports its vast operations. Let's break down its components, activities, and levels of management and decision structure it supports:\n\nComponents of Amazon's Information System:\n1. Hardware: Amazon utilizes a wide range of hardware components, including servers, data centers, networking equipment, and storage devices, to support its information system.\n2. Software: Amazon employs various software applications and platforms, such as customer relationship management (CRM) systems, inventory management systems, order processing systems, and data analytics tools, to manage its operations.\n3. Data: Amazon collects and stores massive amounts of data, including customer information, product details, sales data, and logistics information, which is crucial for its decision-making processes.\n4. Network: Amazon's information system relies on a robust network infrastructure to connect its various components and facilitate data transfer and communication.\n\nActivities of Amazon's Information System:\n1. E-commerce: Amazon's information system enables customers to browse and purchase products online through its website or mobile app. It supports activities like product search, product recommendations, shopping cart management, and secure payment processing.\n2. Inventory Management: Amazon's information system tracks inventory levels in real-time, ensuring efficient stock management, timely replenishment, and accurate order fulfillment.\n3. Logistics and Supply Chain Management: The information system supports activities like order processing, shipment tracking, warehouse management, and transportation optimization to ensure smooth and timely delivery of products.\n4. Customer Relationship Management (CRM): Amazon's information system helps manage customer interactions, including order history, customer support, personalized recommendations, and feedback management.\n\nLevels of Management and Decision Structure Supported:\n1. Operational Level: At this level, the information system supports day-to-day activities like order processing, inventory management, and logistics coordination. It provides real-time data and tools for operational decision-making.\n2. Tactical Level: The information system assists middle-level managers in activities like demand forecasting, pricing strategies, and inventory optimization. It provides analytical tools and reports for tactical decision-making.\n3. Strategic Level: At the top level, the information system supports strategic decision-making, such as market expansion, product diversification, and long-term planning. It provides data analytics, market research, and business intelligence tools to aid in strategic decision-making.\n\nOverall, Amazon's information system plays a critical role in managing its vast operations, supporting various levels of management, and facilitating decision-making processes at different organizational levels.	544
d4a9ad70-e520-4beb-9df7-6fe22a6a3b11	9867e2c4-f124-4f1a-9f04-d4b161706467	ASK/የሰው ልጆች ተደማሪ ፍላጎቶች ምንድን ናቸው? የእነዚህ ፍላጎቶች መጓደል የፈጠረው ሀገራዊ\nጫና ምንድነው? ዴሞክራሲ እነዚህን ፍላጎቶች ከመመለስ አንጻር የሚኖረውን ሚና\nከአስፈላጊነቱ ጋር በማያያዝ አብራሩ? \n2. የብቸኝነት ጉድለት ምን ማለት ነው? የብቸኝነት ጉድለትን ከመሠረታዊ ፖለቲካዊና\nኢኮኖሚያዊ ስብራቶቻችን አንጻር ምን ማለት እንደሆነ አስረ	1. የሰው ልጆች ተደማሪ ፍላጎቶች ሀገራዊ ጫና ምንድን ናቸው?\n   - የሰው ልጆች ተደማሪ ፍላጎቶች ሀገራዊ ጫናውን በማያያዝ አብራሩን እንዲሁም ከመመለስ አንጻር የሚኖረውን ሚና አስፈላጊነቱን ጋር ያለውን ሀገራዊ ጫና ምንድን ናቸው ይጠቀሙበታል።\n\n2. የብቸኝነት ጉድለት ምን ማለት ነው?\n   - የብቸኝነት ጉድለት ለሚከተለው ሰው የሚያስፈልገውን ስብራት እንዲሁም ለሚያስተላልፍው ፖለቲካዊና ኢኮኖሚያዊ ስብራቶች ምንድን ነው ይጠቀሙበታል።	1196
