7edd7679-6828-492b-9350-4399e71e615f	7bda5cee-7ef5-4d96-8c6c-1d09865b14a9	What is Epitacxies?	Epitaxy is a process used in semiconductor manufacturing to grow a thin layer of crystal material on top of a substrate, typically a silicon wafer. This technique is crucial in the production of integrated circuits and other electronic devices. Epitaxial layers are carefully engineered to have specific properties, such as conductivity or optical characteristics, that are different from the substrate material. This allows for the creation of complex electronic structures and the integration of different materials with precise control.	126
4c57947f-9034-41f8-b17f-a42478301a1a	7bda5cee-7ef5-4d96-8c6c-1d09865b14a9	What is VDRL?	VDRL stands for Venereal Disease Research Laboratory. It is a blood test used to screen for syphilis, a sexually transmitted infection caused by the bacterium Treponema pallidum. The VDRL test detects the presence of antibodies produced by the body in response to the infection. It is commonly used as an initial screening test, and if positive, further confirmatory tests are conducted to diagnose syphilis.	118
