uantities like displacement, velocity, acceleration, force, electric and magnetic fields, and more.\n\nUnderstanding vectors is crucial for solving physics problems involving motion, forces, and other physical phenomena. They provide a concise and powerful way to represent and analyze quantities with both magnitude and direction.	440	a3cd6b00-ddce-49fb-90c1-68f8b2d89ddb	2
