spect, courtesy, and fairness. They should also avoid any behavior that could damage the reputation of the auditing profession.\n\n7. Compliance with Laws and Regulations: Auditors must comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and professional standards governing their work. This includes adhering to the Ethiopian Financial Reporting Proclamation, the Ethiopian Accounting and Auditing Board's Code of Ethics, and any other relevant regulations.\n\nEthiopian auditors play a vital role in ensuring the accuracy and reliability of financial information. By upholding high ethical standards, they contribute to the overall trust and confidence in the auditing profession and the financial markets.	450	9986576e-11a2-4865-b1bf-64f8bacc7514	1
