 textile wastewater characterization study will provide valuable insights into the composition and potential impacts of textile wastewater in Hwassa Industrial Park. This information will guide the development of appropriate strategies for the treatment and management of textile wastewater, ensuring the protection of the environment and public health while promoting sustainable practices in the textile industry.	394	6747536c-9a8d-48c1-86c5-277db13c4285	1
