etween meeting shareholder expectations, maintaining financial stability, and pursuing growth opportunities. Regular review and adjustment of the dividend policy can help ensure that it remains aligned with the company's goals and the prevailing market conditions.	705	f6459e93-981b-472f-a3e3-a1fd423c77e3	1
