omprehensiveness of the findings presented in the article.\n- Analyze how the findings contribute to advancing knowledge in the field of strategic management.\n- Evaluate the connection between the results and the research objectives, questions, or hypotheses.\n- Provide concrete examples from the research findings to support your analysis.\n\n6) Overall Critical Comment:\n- Provide an overall critical comment on the relevance of the study as indicated in the article.\n- Consider the problem selected, the methodology followed, the findings, conclusions, and recommendations.\n- Offer a balanced assessment of the strengths and weaknesses of the study.\n- Provide suggestions for further research or improvements that could enhance the study's impact.\n\nRemember to adhere to the requirements and guidelines provided for your review. Your review should be original and based on your own analysis.	508	eb84e572-a653-45b3-a859-e0d4241cfaa0	1
