ent: Regularly reviewing and updating fraud risk management strategies and controls to adapt to changing risks and emerging fraud trends. This includes conducting periodic risk assessments, internal audits, and benchmarking against industry best practices.\n\nBy implementing effective fraud risk management practices, organizations can minimize the potential impact of fraudulent activities and protect their assets, reputation, and stakeholders' trust.	381	70d9ab42-1e43-4586-a322-e62e3df763c1	1
