ms of professionals and coordinate with multiple stakeholders. They need leadership skills to motivate and inspire team members, delegate tasks, and ensure effective collaboration.\n\n8. Adaptability: The field of civil engineering is constantly evolving, with new technologies, materials, and regulations emerging. Civil engineers need to be adaptable and willing to learn and incorporate new knowledge and skills into their work.\n\nThese are just a few of the skills required for a civil engineering job. The specific skills needed may vary depending on the nature of the projects and the industry sector.	424	3b724982-47e6-4d7c-b4a5-eb412bc64656	1
