roups. Finding a balance between preserving cultural identities and fostering social cohesion is crucial for building inclusive and multicultural societies.\n\nAddressing these challenges requires a collective effort from individuals, communities, governments, and international organizations. Promoting cultural understanding, respect, and appreciation can help foster a more inclusive and harmonious global society.	389	4de03421-01cc-4ec1-b693-e6b6b93c0cc9	1
