 engage the reader and advance the narrative.\n\nBoth narrative essays and paragraphs aim to tell a story and evoke emotions or reactions from the reader. They rely on storytelling techniques to create a vivid and engaging narrative experience.	405	9d117349-e88a-4fbd-bcf1-6931e702aeb5	1
