ion:\n   Σi^2 = (n * (n + 1) * (2n + 1)) / 6\n\nTherefore, the formula (n * (n + 1) * (2n + 1)) / 6 is derived as the sum of the squares of the first n natural numbers.	863	0050ea4e-b26c-4370-a529-94340ab399ff	1
