 can be used to analyze training materials, lesson plans, or reflective journals to gain insights into teachers' learning and development.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the types of data analysis that can be used in ELT teachers' professional development. The specific analysis methods chosen will depend on the research questions, data collected, and the goals of the professional development program.	397	e6996fb3-ec5e-457e-9dec-490a795ea103	1
