lopment, teacher autonomy, and the role of teacher associations in supporting ongoing professional growth. [Link: https://academic.oup.com/eltj/article/72/1/77/503703]\n\n5. "Effective Professional Development for English Language Teachers: A Case Study" by International Journal of English Language Teaching: This case study explores a professional development program for English language teachers and examines its impact on teacher knowledge, skills, and classroom practices. It provides insights into the design and implementation of effective professional development initiatives. [Link: https://www.researchgate.net/publication/326618648_Effective_Professional_Development_for_English_Language_Teachers_A_Case_Study]\n\nI hope these articles provide valuable insights into professional development in English Language Teaching. If you have any more specific questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask!	488	897f61d1-233c-4fdf-b9d7-05b77d8c6e9f	1
