 own learning.\n\nThese social and psychological constituents of collaborative learning in EFL classes contribute to creating a supportive and engaging learning environment, promoting language acquisition and overall student development.	350	897f61d1-233c-4fdf-b9d7-05b77d8c6e9f	1
