4642099c-3229-40f6-a244-70f4132e4f95	assistant	2023-11-18 19:26:03.507831	The general term that includes the other three is "Professional Development in ELT (English Language Teaching)". \n\nCurrent trends in ELT refer to the latest developments, approaches, and methodologies being used in the field of English language teaching. It focuses on the new and emerging practices that are gaining popularity among ELT professionals.\n\nCurrent practices in ELT, on the other hand, refer to the methods, techniques, and strategies that are currently being implemented by ELT teachers in their classrooms. These practices are based on established theories and research in the field.\n\nExperiences of ELT teachers professional development encompass the personal journeys and growth of individual teachers in their pursuit of professional development. It includes their reflections, challenges, successes, and lessons learned throughout their career.\n\nWhile all three concepts are related to professional development in ELT, they differ in their focus and scope. Current trends highlight the broader changes and advancements in the field, current practices focus on the specific methods and strategies being used, and experiences of ELT teachers professional development emphasize the personal and professional growth of individual teachers.	212	a3ba61b8-b3e6-486e-8404-6fa42844900d	1
