allenges, factors, problems, and impacts on ELT teachers' professional development. This may involve reviewing relevant literature, theories, and models that have been used to study these factors in the context of professional development.\n\nBy developing a conceptual and theoretical framework that integrates professional development barriers, challenges, factors, problems, and impacts, you can provide a comprehensive understanding of how these elements interact and influence ELT teachers' engagement and outcomes in professional development. This framework will guide your research design, data collection, and analysis, helping you to explore the research questions and hypotheses in your PhD proposal.	431	7d97ed3e-fcaa-4760-a064-2c2b9c0bce5a	1
