ssional development, it can positively impact their children's education. Parents can benefit from knowing that their children are receiving high-quality instruction and support in their language learning journey.\n\n4. Schools: Professional development can contribute to the overall improvement of a school's educational program. It can enhance the reputation of the school, attract more students, and create a positive learning environment.\n\n5. Administrative members: Professional development can help administrators identify areas of improvement and implement effective strategies to enhance the quality of education in their schools.\n\n6. Experts: Researchers and experts in the field of EFL/ELT can benefit from studying professional development as it can contribute to the existing body of knowledge and inform future educational policies and practices.\n\nOverall, studying EFL/ELT professional development in selected schools of Addis Ababa can have a wide range of potential advantages and can benefit various stakeholders involved in the education system.	501	07cf4e34-0b47-4ed6-ad13-06ea4694ec13	1
