ces. Combining software engineering with economics can be beneficial in areas such as algorithmic trading, financial technology (fintech), and economic modeling using computational methods.\n\nThese are just a few examples, and there are many other social science departments that can be paired with software engineering based on specific interests and career goals. It's important to consider your own interests and the specific areas of software engineering you want to focus on when choosing a social science department to complement your studies.	412	08fee921-e442-4398-b504-0a34d65edfcd	1
