ange programs to receive feedback on your progress and areas for improvement.\n\nRemember, learning a language takes time and effort. Stay motivated, be patient with yourself, and enjoy the process of discovering the German language and culture. Viel Erfolg! (Good luck!)	418	a0145c2e-436c-48ca-badc-8b644437b2d2	1
