 focuses on treating everyone the same, while equity recognizes and addresses the different needs and circumstances of individuals or groups to achieve fairness and justice. Both concepts are important in promoting social justice and creating a more inclusive and equitable society.	370	ad234a48-9f72-4fa1-8d42-a0ac5c406938	1
