sition` methods. Finally, it calls the `printLinkedList` method to print the elements of the linked list.\n\nThe `printLinkedList` method is used to print all the elements in the linked list. It takes the head node as a parameter and traverses the linked list, printing the data of each node until it reaches the end.	491	799de2aa-ca01-4757-accd-abc3400645c9	1
