put from port), OUT (output to port), INS (input string from port), and OUTS (output string to port).\n\nThese are some of the main types of instructions supported by the 8086 microprocessor. Each instruction has a specific opcode and syntax that determines its functionality and operands.	474	241fb2d0-8567-449e-9fb3-952bba268d12	1
