 success.\n\n7. Sustainability and follow-up: Establish mechanisms to ensure the sustainability of the EORE program. This may involve training local educators to continue delivering the education, establishing partnerships with local organizations, or integrating EORE into existing educational systems. Regularly follow up with the target population to reinforce the knowledge and skills learned and address any emerging challenges.\n\nRemember, the implementation of EORE should be context-specific and adapted to the needs and resources available in the target area. Collaboration with local communities and stakeholders is crucial for the success and sustainability of the program.	443	2e7ecf99-af55-480a-8181-f5ee23b1e70b	3
